    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p>Faintly glowing magical symbols are etched into this smooth, oval stone. While holding the battery, you can take a Magic action to touch it to a magic item. If that item normally regains expended charges daily, it immediately regains 1d4 + 1 expended charges, and the battery loses its magic.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-csKaA5ZadEQwK04O\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Recharge Item</em> lance les charges rendues : ajoutez-les à la main à l’objet touché.</p></section>",
